| kadid10k/ | Pixabay License | Yes | No (research citation requested) |
| kodak-legacy/ | Unrestricted | Yes | No |
| jxl/ | BSD-3-Clause | Yes | No |
| pngsuite/ | Freeware | Yes | No |
| mozjpeg/ | IJG + BSD | Yes | No |
| image-rs/ | MIT | Yes | No |
