| qoi-benchmark/ | CC0/PD/Mixed | Yes | Varies by subset |

Citation Requirements
---------------------

CID22:
  Jon Sneyers and Moritz Firsching, "Reconstructing JPEG-compressed images
  using Generative Adversarial Networks", Google LLC, 2021.

KADID-10k:
  H. Lin, V. Hosu and D. Saupe, "KADID-10k: A Large-scale Artificially
  Distorted IQA Database," 2019 Eleventh International Conference on
  Quality of Multimedia Experience (QoMEX), Berlin, Germany, 2019,
  pp. 1-3, doi: 10.1109/QoMEX.2019.8743252.

Repository License
------------------

The repository structure, documentation, and scripts (README.md, download
scripts, etc.) are released under CC0 1.0 (public domain).
